{"pageid":4268,"title":"Sap","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sap</span>","revid":22091,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 345px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/42/Sap_Oaklands.png/revision/latest?cb=20260723114043\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jarred Sap (320$) and freshly harvested Sap (80$)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/42/Sap_Oaklands.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/345?cb=20260723114043\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"345\" height=\"305\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sap Oaklands.png\" data-image-key=\"Sap_Oaklands.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sap_Oaklands.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Jarred Sap (320$) and freshly harvested Sap (80$)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Sap is a small orange translucent crystal-like shaped object. It is known to spawn either attached to trees (It prefers spawning on Red Maple tree, which is usually found in meadows and grasslands) but however it is mainly seen dropped on the ground near trees. It sells for 80$ in its freshly harvested form, and 320$ in it’s jam form. The jam takes a glass effect, making it look more viscose and fluid.  \n</p><p>In-game description:\n</p><p>\"A sticky, nourishing fluid that flows through trees, used for food and crafting.\"\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 305px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/Sap_Oaklands_Sighting.png/revision/latest?cb=20260723114407\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sap Sighting on the Red Maple tree near a Lighthouse.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/Sap_Oaklands_Sighting.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/305?cb=20260723114407\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"305\" height=\"347\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sap Oaklands Sighting.png\" data-image-key=\"Sap_Oaklands_Sighting.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sap_Oaklands_Sighting.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Sap Sighting on the Red Maple tree near a Lighthouse.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n(For future editors, im not sure if thats all that sap can do, description says it used for crafting but i could not find any craft with that item)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903010500\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4268-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903010500 and revision id 22091. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[],"images":["Sap_Oaklands.png","Sap_Oaklands_Sighting.png"]}
